{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ieVifQflDz1794371477.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>旺角有唐樓單位發生火警，至少5人不適，部分人要送院，初步調查同充電器起火有關。</p><p></p><p>火警後，大批消防員趕到現場，消防車升起雲梯。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PICTURE J.FIRE.MK-1100.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HObGIzhcfr1794371470.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>起火大廈正進行外牆維修，搭建了棚架和棚網。多名住客疏散到街外暫避，有女童受驚，家人帶同寵物貓逃生。</p><p></p><p>三樓住戶夏小朋友說：「起床時，有人不斷拍門，我很害怕。然後突然間有消防員衝進來，又出了去。我就跟姐姐說，姐姐立刻叫我走，然後就叫我和哥哥走。很害怕，很害怕又要搬屋。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PICTURE J.FIRE.MK-1100 (2).png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263D1nolsuqX1794371481.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方早上7時許接報，新填地街316號永福大廈一個單位冒煙，消防出動一隊煙帽隊及一條喉灌救，約半小時將火救熄。消防初步調查相信單位內有充電器起火。有男住客吸入濃煙不適，清醒送往廣華醫院治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PICTURE J.FIRE.MK-1100 (4).png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ucyUdkg9Qx1794371474.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>受火警影響，新填地街和登打士街一度封閉。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.657441+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:52:27.590322+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:07.083375+00:00","content_hash":"84bd40cfdfd13f1e25bcfce4f41904bb4e1fdac9575dac4e6ab53a8d348af91d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.657441+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}